                .env("REPLACE")
                .help("Replace anything in scope with this value.")
                .long_help("Replace anything in scope with this value.\n\nVariables are supported: if a regex pattern was used for scoping and captured content in named or numbered capture groups, access these in the replacement value using `$1` etc. for numbered, `$NAME` etc. for named capture groups.\n\nThis action is specially treated as a positional argument for ergonomics and compatibility with `tr`.\n\nIf given, will run before any other action.")
